Walking along the shore, east of the hot springs, you’ll find nearly desolate “Golden Beach�[�] with a[ single (]excellent) taverna[ to] quench your thirst and fill your belly. Rockh[ounds] will find specimens in a rainbow of colors and plentiful quartz.
